        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Henry Wadsworth Longfellow, Dante Alighieri\n- Groups: Fireside Poets\n- Works: Divine Comedy\n- Places: New England\n- Topics: American poetry, translation\n\nFacts:\n- The Fireside Poets were a group of 19th-century American poets associated with New England.\n- The Fireside Poets were also known as the Schoolroom Poets and the Household Poets.\n- Henry Wadsworth Longfellow was one of the five Fireside Poets from New England.\n- Henry Wadsworth Longfellow was the first American to translate Dante Alighieri's Divine Comedy.",
